Subject: [PATCH] feat(mcp): offer existing editing tools in local chat

Add rename_operation, edit_tool and set_work_material to the core set. Pin provider schemas, local panel exposure, and the real rename and Undo Turn workflow without live inference.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI GPT-6.1 Sol <noreply@openai.com>

